OL,3,GNEWSAOnline racism 'worse now' local
OL,4,Apoliticians say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Sunderland councillor Stephen
OL,7,FLewis Elms, who is mixed-race, said he
OL,8,Fhad experienced people online making
OL,9,Fracist AI images. The local authority
OL,10,Fsaid nobody should be the target of
OL,11,Fabuse.
